[[Open This|GS: Introduction]]

---

Oxide Computer is an efficient, rack-scale computing system complete with hardware and software. It has many of the same benefits of cloud hyperscale infrastructure in terms of developer productivity but at a much lower long-term infrastructure cost. The product is intended for use in on-premises deployments and the unit of purchase is a fully integrated rack.